{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"510","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"0","news_title":"中科園區巡迴巴士自105年9月1日起調整","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:heiti tc; font-size:11.1734px; letter-spacing:1px; line-height:15.6428px; width:100%\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\">\n\t\t\t<p><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"sans-serif, Arial, Verdana, Trebuchet MS\"><span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:normal; line-height:20.8px\">1.西屯線調整10:00～15:40間自中科轉運站發車的班次改道行駛西屯B線(如圖)。<br />\n\t\t\t2.園區線-標準廠房段取消7:40、9:58二班次。<br />\n\t\t\t3.后里線新增 08:10 自后里火車站發車班次。<br />\n\t\t\t4.后里線、后科線、后科南線取消「義里郵局站」，改設「后里國小」站。<br />\n\t\t\t5.七星線取消「三豐甲后站」與「義里郵局站」。</span></font></p>\n\n\t\t\t<p>$=!!nbsp;</p>\n\n\t\t\t<p><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"sans-serif, Arial, Verdana, Trebuchet MS\"><span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:normal; line-height:20.8px\">詳情請見中科管理局網站：</span></font>http://www.ctsp.gov.tw/chinese/01news/11online_view.aspx?v=1$=!!amp;fr=17$=!!amp;no=34$=!!amp;sn=4814</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"510","create_date":"2016-08-19","clk_count":"194"}},"__N_SSG":true}